{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_title", "source_sha256": "5374f7effbec213ef96acdff7b36d152ba24485f3be1dcab2df938c5af99cb9f", "ja": "紬とおでかけ2", "zh": "和紬一起外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "abe9e9605fd36ea6c5e6990bdadf66a33fccc208bc42bcb4eaf86db89fafef2e", "ja": "紬とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和紬一同出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cfd32b8ec7db6ed176c6edd9ffaaa0f073378a9dd0719df66804e63225b019d9", "ja": "（紬と一緒に、倉敷にやってきた。綺麗なところだな\n……これならきっと、紬も気に入るだろう）", "zh": "（和紬一起，来到了仓敷。真是个漂亮的地方啊……这样一来，紬肯定也会喜欢吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "af017c0d2017f4e1350be660adbc6cfd77bc2921c86d7156eb671db8ba316913", "ja": "美しい街並みですね……。この景観を保つには、\n大変な労力がかかっているでしょうに。", "zh": "真是美丽的街景……。要维持这样的景观，想必需要付出相当大的努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a75596c79e62a7a760506c250b01e4d96d9b8eb043a8ee33e5c1a032648e1736", "ja": "労力か……確かに、こういう古い街並みは、\n努めて保存しないと残らないよな。", "zh": "劳力啊……确实，这种古老的街景如果不努力保护，是留存不下来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "20e6ad448f31ba0f98559b9727e1f80822f10a36e9446598edee6bbbeb5143ab", "ja": "ええ。行政と地域が一体となって、姿を残す……\n古都とは、そういうものです。……あ。", "zh": "是的。行政与当地居民齐心协力，保留下这番风貌……\n所谓古都，就是这样的地方。……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4f37b392a424b266cd93184f3f18759aff2de43cc543c0f599ca923333227676", "ja": "あそこにあるのは……あんみつ屋さんかな？\n紬……。", "zh": "那里的是……甜品店吗？\n纺……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "533e7ff8957b511278833fd615a5bc2bd7291ba7d382bbc523ecc5fc3c4e218a", "ja": "わ、私は食べたいなどと言っていません。\nあなたは、私の食い意地が張っているとでも？", "zh": "我、我可没说想吃。\n你是觉得我嘴馋吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e57be162d3cba83363f62ac1876ef5624542accf6cca74c9c516612cbbf3b913", "ja": "そんな事はないけど……疲れたし、少し休憩したいな。\nよし、入ろう紬！", "zh": "倒也不是……只是有点累了，想稍微休息一下。\n好，我们进去吧，紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a6b34201a230c045f22f29e6d363f86a7987ea2918063aeea3053c408a60ebf7", "ja": "！　なんなん……。", "zh": "！搞什么啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_051tmg02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "216196190717f6344636051528ed1d175f4461f3cf71f552f7cf3f05ac602461", "ja": "（その後は、紬と一緒にあんみつを食べた。\n……うん、紬の幸せそうな顔が見られてよかったな！）", "zh": "（在那之后，我和紬一起吃了金豆凉粉。\n……嗯，能看到紬那副幸福的表情，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
